recursive-include devcovenant/builtin/policies *
prune devcovenant/custom
include devcovenant/custom/__init__.py
include devcovenant/custom/README.md
include devcovenant/custom/policies/__init__.py
include devcovenant/custom/policies/README.md
include devcovenant/custom/profiles/__init__.py
include devcovenant/custom/profiles/README.md
